WEBVTT

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:07.771
Stear, Archie,
I'm going to strike out on my own.

00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:16.797
After losing her beloved Anthony,

00:00:17.514 --> 00:00:19.574
Candy returned to Pony's home.

00:00:21.556 --> 00:00:26.591
Father-tree knows.

00:00:32.177 --> 00:00:36.427
Pony's home, the place Candy was so
fond of,

00:00:36.462 --> 00:00:39.256
...hasn't changed at all.

00:00:40.843 --> 00:00:45.776
However... what she found there
were more memories of Anthony.

00:01:11.038 --> 00:01:12.987
Candy... let's ride!

00:01:13.022 --> 00:01:13.738
Yes!

00:01:29.279 --> 00:01:32.469
Candy, relax...
Just don't fall from my arms!

00:01:32.614 --> 00:01:35.250
It's okay.
I'm holding on tightly!

00:02:02.456 --> 00:02:03.344
Candy?

00:02:15.881 --> 00:02:22.082
Sister Pony, do you know that Candy keeps
sighing and occasionally breaks out in tears?

00:02:22.117 --> 00:02:24.117
Yes, I know.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.029
I wonder was it good
for her to return at this time...

00:02:27.064 --> 00:02:29.392
That's the very reason
why she returned now.

00:02:30.807 --> 00:02:35.337
She returned here to draw her attention
away from the sadness within.

00:02:35.463 --> 00:02:41.130
I'm sure that she's now gathering the
strenght she needs to overcome the sadness.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:45.928
What, "Candy, candy"...!
Wasting too many words on her!

00:02:45.994 --> 00:02:50.079
Jimmy, you just came to Pony's home,
and you don't know anything about Candy,

00:02:50.114 --> 00:02:51.683
...so you can't say such things!

00:02:52.256 --> 00:03:00.229
John, you're always talking about Candy,
but she's really a no-good weepy bitch!

00:03:00.264 --> 00:03:02.620
Don't say such things!

00:03:02.933 --> 00:03:04.127
What was that again?

00:03:04.525 --> 00:03:05.506
Want some?

00:03:07.939 --> 00:03:10.782
Listen up! Ever since Candy came,
she's been acting like a boss!

00:03:11.002 --> 00:03:13.481
But the real boss is right here.

00:03:13.672 --> 00:03:16.735
But... Candy gets all scary when she's mad.

00:03:19.019 --> 00:03:21.391
Let's make her angry, then!

00:03:21.402 --> 00:03:23.570
-Don't do that!
-Shut up!

00:03:28.657 --> 00:03:30.985
-Hey, don't...
-She's just a crybaby!

00:03:41.044 --> 00:03:41.870
It's a rose!

00:03:42.099 --> 00:03:46.849
Got you there!
You like roses, don't you!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.029
Hey, what are you doing?

00:03:49.223 --> 00:03:51.388
Now she's gonna get mad.

00:03:51.431 --> 00:03:52.397
Wait up!

00:03:52.808 --> 00:03:55.201
I'm not scared of you!

00:03:55.351 --> 00:03:59.738
You're just moping around alone, as if a
saddest thing in the world happened to you!

00:04:00.112 --> 00:04:02.135
Crybaby!

00:04:02.796 --> 00:04:03.737
Crybaby?

00:04:05.062 --> 00:04:08.371
Come to think of it, it was the
same when I first met Anthony...

00:04:09.538 --> 00:04:11.566
Hello, miss Crybaby!

00:04:17.718 --> 00:04:18.648
Anthony.

00:04:21.892 --> 00:04:23.668
There she goes again!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.686
Sir, your voyage was so long.

00:04:49.721 --> 00:04:50.777
Maybe so.

00:04:51.163 --> 00:04:54.609
I'm indebted to you two for
taking care of Anthony.

00:04:55.522 --> 00:04:59.500
As a father, there was nothing I could do.

00:04:59.535 --> 00:05:02.747
Mister, we are your friends.

00:05:03.647 --> 00:05:05.826
We'll be waiting.
Please come see us again.

00:05:06.602 --> 00:05:09.225
Thank you.
Take care.

00:05:10.445 --> 00:05:12.505
Mister, you take care, too.

00:05:14.372 --> 00:05:17.938
I would like you two to take all
Anthony's belongings.

00:05:18.313 --> 00:05:24.144
Afterwards... give them to that girl
you've been telling me about.

00:05:26.148 --> 00:05:28.003
I would like to meet her someday.

00:05:30.098 --> 00:05:32.653
-We understand, mister.
-Take care!

00:05:35.099 --> 00:05:38.784
-Take me to rose gates!
-I understand.

00:05:41.863 --> 00:05:45.894
He lost his wife... and now
this kind old man lost his son.

00:05:46.265 --> 00:05:47.594
What is left for him now?

00:05:48.342 --> 00:05:52.055
Will he have someone to laugh with
or just someone to say "hello" to?

00:05:52.462 --> 00:05:54.873
Yesterday, he stood at the
rose gates all night long.

00:05:55.162 --> 00:05:56.626
He just stood there.

00:05:57.051 --> 00:05:59.093
I know. It was such a cold night.

00:06:05.303 --> 00:06:07.443
I wonder what Candy is doing right now.

00:06:07.593 --> 00:06:10.201
Let's leave her alone
until she regains her footing.

00:06:10.704 --> 00:06:13.836
Everyone seems to be
lost in sadness right now.

00:06:24.671 --> 00:06:25.690
There he goes again.

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:31.992
I'm gonna get her mad this time!
Just look at this!

00:06:34.718 --> 00:06:36.637
What's this...

00:06:38.292 --> 00:06:40.857
Now you did it!

00:06:41.709 --> 00:06:43.073
Aaah! "We did it?!"

00:06:43.189 --> 00:06:45.435
I'm gonna kick your assess!

00:06:46.099 --> 00:06:47.118
Run!

00:06:47.367 --> 00:06:48.885
She's gone nuts!

00:06:50.486 --> 00:06:52.048
Wait, you!

00:07:14.531 --> 00:07:16.346
Pony's hill.

00:07:24.793 --> 00:07:28.829
It's Pony's hill.
The hill where I first met the Prince.

00:07:30.104 --> 00:07:36.291
And so, Candy came to the hill where
she promised to go together with Anthony.

00:07:50.321 --> 00:07:51.127
I hear it...

00:07:51.707 --> 00:07:53.633
I hear the sound of bagpipes!

00:07:53.987 --> 00:07:57.013
These are bagpipes. Okay? Want to hear?

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:00.889
It sounds like snails are having a party!

00:08:01.449 --> 00:08:03.294
Snails? That's a good one!

00:08:04.814 --> 00:08:05.846
Prince!

00:08:06.475 --> 00:08:08.244
Cheer up, miss Freckle!

00:08:08.829 --> 00:08:11.669
-This weepy face looks strange on you!
-But...

00:08:12.669 --> 00:08:14.958
...it's because you, Anthony, have died!

00:08:15.568 --> 00:08:16.412
Candy!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:19.056
Candy!

00:08:20.453 --> 00:08:21.415
Anthony!

00:08:23.925 --> 00:08:29.547
Candy, I'm right here.
Look. Right next to you. Always.

00:08:31.314 --> 00:08:32.577
Anthony!

00:08:33.873 --> 00:08:36.857
Candy, winter is drawing near.

00:08:37.174 --> 00:08:38.335
Roses are going to die.

00:08:38.969 --> 00:08:44.575
But that's the very reason
the springtime roses bloom so beautifully.

00:08:46.098 --> 00:08:47.566
The flowers die,

00:08:47.568 --> 00:08:52.066
...but they are reborn inside human hearts
where they keep living eternally.

00:09:03.214 --> 00:09:08.858
What's the matter, Candy!
You can't catch up to us!

00:09:12.043 --> 00:09:16.890
Crybaby Candy!

00:09:35.112 --> 00:09:39.363
Candy?
Candy, why are you looking so lonely?

00:09:41.169 --> 00:09:42.361
Anthony - -

00:09:43.264 --> 00:09:47.391
Are you not going to appear
in my memories anymore?

00:09:51.602 --> 00:09:55.362
Anthony...
My Anthony!

00:10:01.639 --> 00:10:04.048
It went pretty well today...

00:10:04.378 --> 00:10:07.014
If everybody could try just a little
harder the next time we go...

00:10:07.049 --> 00:10:08.892
That's right... it's almost Christmas.

00:10:09.625 --> 00:10:14.144
Sister Pony, sister Lane and everybody
are rising donations.

00:10:16.971 --> 00:10:19.660
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
>.>

00:10:20.279 --> 00:10:23.287
Sister Pony, let's give it another
try tommorrow.

00:10:23.344 --> 00:10:28.148
That's right. We'll buy presents
for the children with this money.

00:10:28.443 --> 00:10:29.313
Candy?

00:10:29.348 --> 00:10:32.367
Let me handle the donations!

00:10:32.913 --> 00:10:35.628
Candy, eavesdropping is bad!

00:10:36.618 --> 00:10:39.372
I'm sorry. But I want to be helpful!

00:10:39.562 --> 00:10:41.936
Thank you, Candy.
But it's okay.

00:10:41.937 --> 00:10:43.157
Why is that?

00:10:43.529 --> 00:10:46.064
Don't you have something to do?

00:10:46.649 --> 00:10:47.687
Something to do?

00:10:47.722 --> 00:10:49.382
That's right.

00:10:49.532 --> 00:10:54.371
You need to get well quickly, after
having your heart broken in such a way!

00:10:55.899 --> 00:10:59.476
Candy, there's more than just sadness
over his death,

00:10:59.511 --> 00:11:03.303
...you should be happy because you
got to meet such a wonderful boy!

00:11:03.338 --> 00:11:05.400
To meet Anthony...

00:11:06.345 --> 00:11:10.498
Candy, fate is something
you build with your own hands!

00:11:10.499 --> 00:11:11.340
Understand?

00:11:11.556 --> 00:11:13.172
That's right, Candy.

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:17.079
You came back to Pony's home, a place
where you lived ever since you were a baby.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:19.809
Therefore, I'm sure you'll
be able to find your strength here.

00:11:20.005 --> 00:11:22.935
Think about it, just what did you come back for?

00:11:23.343 --> 00:11:26.981
That's right...
That's exactly why I came back here.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.384
And instead, I was just moping around...

00:11:31.189 --> 00:11:33.627
Candy, do you know Jimmy?

00:11:34.586 --> 00:11:37.708
Jimmy? That mischievous kid?

00:11:37.743 --> 00:11:42.127
That's right. He came here
after his mother was sold off.

00:11:42.318 --> 00:11:43.627
His mother?

00:11:44.822 --> 00:11:46.539
I didn't know that...

00:11:47.281 --> 00:11:49.833
Yes. He appears lively and brazen,

00:11:49.868 --> 00:11:54.665
...but I think that it's just his way
of bearing this situation.

00:11:55.055 --> 00:11:57.711
It's his way of bearing this...

00:11:57.746 --> 00:12:02.498
You're just moping around alone, as if a
saddest thing in the world happened to you!

00:12:04.972 --> 00:12:07.525
I... I have to bear it too.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:11.311
All children are waiting for your smile!

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:12.808
My smile?

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:19.361
I see, sister Pony, sister Lane.

00:12:25.919 --> 00:12:28.217
Joe, you're bad, as always!

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:32.432
Milly, what did you do with your pillow?

00:12:33.758 --> 00:12:35.084
She's so troublesome.

00:12:35.829 --> 00:12:38.219
John, you didn't pee again, right?

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:41.337
He really stopped wetting his bed!

00:12:41.759 --> 00:12:44.632
Kurin, did you pee again...

00:12:46.338 --> 00:12:47.933
Huh? Jimmy is gone.

00:13:00.667 --> 00:13:03.363
I wonder where did he go in this cold...

00:13:07.253 --> 00:13:08.696
It's Jimmy's hat.

00:13:10.438 --> 00:13:12.887
He's so reckless, dropping it out here...

00:13:22.143 --> 00:13:23.101
Jimmy?

00:13:31.107 --> 00:13:32.101
Mom...

00:13:36.562 --> 00:13:39.660
You looked so strong...
But in reality...

00:13:39.783 --> 00:13:40.539
Jimmy!

00:13:41.933 --> 00:13:43.174
Mom...

00:13:44.669 --> 00:13:45.892
I'd better leave him.

00:13:51.825 --> 00:13:54.477
Jimmy, you're lonely, too?

00:14:07.927 --> 00:14:08.912
It's already morning.

00:14:09.266 --> 00:14:10.957
I'm gonna work hard from today!

00:14:11.508 --> 00:14:12.274
Huh?

00:14:14.359 --> 00:14:16.103
Kurin, just how long...

00:14:18.379 --> 00:14:19.399
John!

00:14:20.845 --> 00:14:22.454
Okay now, get up, John!

00:14:25.031 --> 00:14:26.617
When did you get in here?

00:14:26.835 --> 00:14:30.692
I'm sorry. I messed up my bed.

00:14:30.889 --> 00:14:33.895
You wet your bed again?
Uh, and you changed your pajama?

00:14:36.678 --> 00:14:38.958
And you went into my bed like that!

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:42.897
Look, it's already dry!

00:14:42.932 --> 00:14:44.462
That's not the problem, you filthy runt!

00:14:44.497 --> 00:14:47.648
I thought you stopped wetting your bed!

00:14:47.683 --> 00:14:50.064
I did, I did but...

00:14:50.099 --> 00:14:51.769
It doesn't seem so!

00:14:51.804 --> 00:14:53.936
It's because I was so worried about you...

00:14:56.336 --> 00:14:58.686
And so...
I'm sorry.

00:14:59.059 --> 00:15:01.256
I'm sorry for making you worry...

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.505
-Come here!
-Kurin!

00:15:10.404 --> 00:15:12.362
Jimmy, what are you doing to Kurin?

00:15:12.456 --> 00:15:13.850
I'm teaching it to follow me!

00:15:14.984 --> 00:15:15.738
Ow!

00:15:17.873 --> 00:15:19.238
Stop that!

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:26.974
Why were you doing that to the poor creature?

00:15:27.371 --> 00:15:29.874
I was showing it who is the boss around here!

00:15:30.118 --> 00:15:32.496
You just came here and you're already the boss?

00:15:32.708 --> 00:15:34.895
What? You came after me!

00:15:34.941 --> 00:15:37.386
I was here long before you came!

00:15:37.855 --> 00:15:40.326
But... then I went away for awhile...

00:15:40.673 --> 00:15:43.766
Alright, I understand.
We need to decide who the boss is.

00:15:45.332 --> 00:15:48.170
Naturally, I should be the boss!

00:15:48.354 --> 00:15:49.308
You shouldn't!

00:15:49.752 --> 00:15:51.352
What are you going to do about it?

00:15:51.704 --> 00:15:53.102
Okay! Come here!

00:15:53.885 --> 00:15:58.365
Listen up. I'll race you to that tree!
The one who gets there first is a boss!

00:15:58.400 --> 00:15:58.993
Fine with me!

00:15:58.994 --> 00:16:00.564
Okay, start!

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:05.724
That's a Christmas cracker...
Where did you take it?

00:16:05.887 --> 00:16:08.938
-Ca... Candy, hurry!
-Oh, that's right...

00:16:12.691 --> 00:16:13.727
I remember...

00:16:13.796 --> 00:16:15.245
It's just like times when I was little.

00:16:15.662 --> 00:16:17.427
The hill to which I ran
until running out of breath...

00:16:17.788 --> 00:16:21.146
The hill to which I fled when
sister Pony and sister Lane were after me...

00:16:21.163 --> 00:16:23.373
The hill to which I ran every day...

00:16:24.301 --> 00:16:28.005
Candy, don't run like that,
you'll get hurt!

00:16:29.146 --> 00:16:31.436
Oh, that girl!

00:16:39.732 --> 00:16:40.909
A piece of cake!

00:16:42.916 --> 00:16:43.836
Goin' ahead!

00:16:46.267 --> 00:16:47.305
I'm here!

00:16:50.242 --> 00:16:52.918
Well, Jimmy, are you going to
let me be the boss?

00:16:53.888 --> 00:16:56.040
What, after this?

00:16:57.852 --> 00:17:00.289
I'm not feeling too well today...

00:17:00.462 --> 00:17:01.643
But you won't be able to beat me
in tree climbing!

00:17:01.644 --> 00:17:02.769
Oh, I'm okay with that!

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:11.847
I'm leading!

00:17:11.882 --> 00:17:15.413
I'm much better than her,
she's totally fallen behind.

00:17:25.942 --> 00:17:29.166
Whenever I climbed this tree,
I got scolded by teachers...

00:17:29.523 --> 00:17:33.338
That's it! It was this branch!
Annie always worried and watched from below!

00:17:33.373 --> 00:17:36.931
Candy, look out!
Teachers will be mad!

00:17:36.966 --> 00:17:38.848
It's okay!

00:17:40.051 --> 00:17:41.591
Candy!

00:17:41.803 --> 00:17:44.381
Candy, again?!
Get down!

00:17:44.416 --> 00:17:45.848
They found me!

00:17:46.053 --> 00:17:49.362
How many times have I told you?
You're not thinking anything!

00:17:49.397 --> 00:17:52.072
-Get down!
-I'm sorry!

00:17:52.107 --> 00:17:54.651
No, don't go like that...!

00:17:54.686 --> 00:17:56.271
Candy, what are you doing?

00:17:56.386 --> 00:17:59.754
-You're going to lose to Jimmy!
-Oh, no!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.299
You can't catch up to me!

00:18:08.121 --> 00:18:11.324
Just a little bit more.
Candy is all the way down there...

00:18:13.873 --> 00:18:16.403
She's already here!

00:18:22.346 --> 00:18:24.085
She's incredible!

00:18:27.495 --> 00:18:29.426
That's our Candy!
You're incredible!

00:18:31.066 --> 00:18:32.189
I'm there!

00:18:35.397 --> 00:18:36.649
Take my hand.

00:18:36.791 --> 00:18:38.590
I don't want your help!

00:18:39.049 --> 00:18:43.365
You're so stubborn...
Jimmy, this tree is a father-tree!

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.787
-Father?
-That's right.

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:47.720
This tree will listen to everything you say!

00:18:48.314 --> 00:18:51.041
-Jimmy, you already know that!
-I don't...

00:18:51.391 --> 00:18:53.847
But you were crying here
the last night, weren't you?

00:18:56.092 --> 00:18:57.658
Candy, you saw me?

00:18:59.831 --> 00:19:04.567
Yes. I came for the same reason,
but then I saw you got there first.

00:19:04.724 --> 00:19:07.954
Candy, so you were crying here, as well?

00:19:08.128 --> 00:19:13.601
Yes. But I had to forget it quickly!
One can't keep moping around forever!

00:19:14.678 --> 00:19:17.804
Jimmy, thanks to you,
I'm feeling better now.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:25.158
Wonderful! It's been a long time
since I felt something this good!

00:19:34.876 --> 00:19:37.452
Sister Pony, sister Lane!!!

00:19:41.693 --> 00:19:43.212
-It's dangerous....!
-Oh crap.

00:19:43.621 --> 00:19:46.777
Get down, Candy!
Slowly, get down!

00:19:49.346 --> 00:19:52.709
It's just like in the old times.
I wonder will they scold us again.

00:19:52.744 --> 00:19:57.038
It's okay, they may be loud but
they never get mean!

00:20:00.283 --> 00:20:03.308
You look just like me from the past!

00:20:05.995 --> 00:20:08.338
We look away a bit and you do this...

00:20:08.944 --> 00:20:11.186
Candy first thought of it!

00:20:14.694 --> 00:20:15.604
Jimmy...

00:20:17.369 --> 00:20:18.278
Boss.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:30.610
-Did he say "boss"?
-I think so...

00:20:30.944 --> 00:20:32.141
It's snowing!

00:20:32.176 --> 00:20:34.773
Yes! The flakes look like rose petals!

00:20:43.574 --> 00:20:45.410
Everything is turning white...

00:20:46.178 --> 00:20:48.812
and I... I won't cry anymore.

00:20:49.228 --> 00:20:50.631
I'll live strongly from now on.

00:20:52.319 --> 00:20:57.236
The snow gently covered all sadness.

00:20:58.099 --> 00:21:01.362
And Christmas was just around the corner.

00:21:02.117 --> 00:21:05.135
To be continued...
